      "created_at": "2011-11-10T23:33:29.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>Hey, folks.</p>\n<p>A friend brought this up last night during a game. Was wondering if anyone else had found similar humor in wording that was not intended to be humorous. (There’s lots of humorous wording - the flavor text is just generally awesome!  :D)</p>\n<p>Tachyon’s <span class=\"bbcode-i\">Supersonic Response</span> says “If that target dealt tachyon damage since your last turn…”</p>\n<p>His question: “What character deals tachyon (type of) damage?”</p>\n<p>…</p>\n<p>Maybe you had to be there.</p>\n<ol start=\"8\">\n<li>\n</li></ol>\n<p>Rabit</p>",
      "post_number": 1,
      "post_type": 1,
      "updated_at": "2021-02-07T01:34:56.768Z",
      "reply_count": 0,
      "reply_to_post_number": null,
